static WCHAR *multiWide(const char *p){UINT bytes=1,n;WCHAR *out,*q;const char *s;if(!p)return NULL;for(s=p;*s;s+=lstrlenA(s)+1){n=MultiByteToWideChar(CP_ACP,0,s,-1,NULL,0);if(!n||bytes>0x1000000-n)return NULL;bytes+=n;}out=Z7ShellAlloc(bytes*2);if(!out)return NULL;q=out;for(s=p;*s;s+=lstrlenA(s)+1){n=MultiByteToWideChar(CP_ACP,0,s,-1,q,bytes-(q-out));if(!n){Z7ShellFree(out);return NULL;}q+=n;}*q=0;return out;}
